OL,3,GNEWSAPolice tutor and student resign
OL,4,Aover sexual affair
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers who started a
OL,7,Fsexual relationship while they were
OL,8,Ftutor and student have been found
OL,9,Fguilty of gross misconduct following a
OL,10,Fdisciplinary hearing.
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Police said PC Mark
OL,13,FRobinson and Trainee Det Con Bethany
OL,14,FWilkins would have been sacked had they
OL,15,Fnot both resigned.
OL,17,FWilkins gave up her job before the
OL,18,Fhearing on 19 October and Robinson quit
OL,19,Fduring a break in the proceedings.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
