OL,3,GNEWSAPolice tutor and student resign
OL,4,Aover sexual affair
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said they both attended a
OL,7,Fmeeting in March 2023 and stated their
OL,8,Frelationship was as a tutor and
OL,9,Fstudent, but the hearing said evidence
OL,10,Fof texts, a photo and a hotel booking
OL,11,Fproved it was a lie.
